## Installing the Chart

To install the chart with the release name `my-release`:

```console
$ helm repo add helm-custom-job git+https://bitbucket.org/asteriosoft/helm-custom-job?ref={{ template "chart.version" . }}
$ helm install my-release helm-custom-job/{{ template "chart.name" . }}
```

